# The bind mount ssg-worker promotes into, and the external nginx serves.
#
# Ignored rather than kept with a .gitkeep: the worker runs as root, so every
# local build drops root-owned directories in here and they would otherwise
# show up in `git status` (and need sudo to clear). Clean them from inside the
# container instead:
#
#   docker compose -f docker/dev/compose.yaml exec ssg-worker sh -c 'rm -rf /opt/ssg/published/*'
*
!.gitignore
